Description: OpenZFS kernel module for Linux @RELEASE@
 The ZFS module of zfs-linux @ZFS_VERSION@, built for the HyprDebian kernel
 @RELEASE@ and signed with the key the kernel was built with, so no system
 needs DKMS or a compiler for ZFS. See hd-kernel(7).
